# Mechanic: confirmed opponent blocks must stay identifiable at pre-damage priority.
# Forcing: two safe defenders can block two attackers; Carrion Feeder retains a sacrifice response.
# AI behavior: no hand or mana actions, only combat assignments.
# Failure mode: native blockInfo exists while the board shows no attacker/blocker relationships.
